# archive/ is out of scope

`archive/` holds superseded work: the Experiment 02 and 03 source trees, plus the
Experiment 04 and 05 zips. It is not deployed and is not part of the active codebase.

It is listed in [`.cursorignore`](../../.cursorignore) so Cursor does not index it for search or @ context.

- Do not search, read, or cite `archive/` when answering general questions.
- Active LWC source is `force-app/main/default/lwc/` only.
- Read `archive/` only when the user names a path inside it or explicitly asks
  about a past experiment.
- Exclude `archive/` from diff and change summaries unless asked. Line-ending-only
  churn there is expected and not meaningful.
